      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹1.64 (vs ₹1.20 in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹1.64 (up from ₹1.20 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹906.5m (up 2.8% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹282.6m (up 44% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 31% (up from 22% in FY 2025). The increase in margin was primarily driven by lower expenses.",
